res; WGC technology demand |\n| **Tanaka Kikinzoku** | Japan | Bonding wire and industrial gold products for electronics. | Company disclosures |\n| **Sumitomo Metal Mining** | Japan | Bonding wire and materials; also a gold refiner. | Company annual report |\n| **TSMC** | Taiwan | Advanced-node foundry; gold enters via packaging, bonding and plating. | Company annual report; USGS |\n| **ASE Technology** | Taiwan | World's largest OSAT \u2014 wire bonding is a core gold-consuming process. | Company annual report |\n| **Amkor Technology** | US / Korea | Major OSAT; wire bond and flip-chip packaging. | Company annual report |\n| **Hon Hai / Foxconn** | Taiwan / China | Largest electronics contract manufacturer; connector and PCB gold plating. | Company annual report |\n| **TE Connectivity** | Switzerland / US | Connectors and sensors; gold-plated contact surfaces. | Company annual report |\n| **Amphenol** | US | Connectors and interconnect; gold plating on contacts. | Company annual report |\n| **Molex (Koch)** | US | Connector maker; gold-plated contacts. | Company disclosures |\n\n#### Refiners\n\n| Refiner | Base | Role | Source |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Valcambi** | Switzerland | LBMA Good Delivery. Switzerland is the world's largest refining hub. | LBMA Good Delivery List |\n| **PAMP (MKS PAMP)** | Switzerland | LBMA Good Delivery; large bar and minted-product refiner. | LBMA Good Delivery List |\n| **Metalor Technologies** | Switzerland | LBMA Good Delivery; refining plus industrial precious metals. | LBMA Good Delivery List |\n| **Argor-Heraeus** | Switzerland | LBMA Good Delivery; Heraeus-affiliated refiner. | LBMA Good Delivery List |\n| **Heraeus Precious Metals** | Germany | LBMA Good Delivery; refining and industrial recycling. | LBMA Good Delivery List |\n| **Tanaka Kikinzoku Kogyo** | Japan | LBMA Good Delivery; refiner and fabricator. | LBMA Good Delivery List |\n| **Asahi Refining** | US / Canada | LBMA Good Delivery; North American refining capacity. 